          "source_text": "Suppose given <MATH_0001>\na <TEXTBFOPEN_0001>finite<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001> collection of\nformulas of set theory. Let <MATH_0002> be a set.\nThere exists a set <MATH_0003> such that\n<MATH_0004> and\n<MATH_0005>, we have\n<MATH_0006>\nIn fact we may take <MATH_0007> for some limit ordinal <MATH_0008>.\n",
